{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9328.063061,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9734.155730999999,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9787.983306999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9790.013619000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9791.309307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9791.911983999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9793.507021000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9795.146015999999,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":19619.934116,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht,"},{"kind":"text","t":19908.066021000002,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think,"},{"kind":"audio","t":19951.410957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19952.807647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19954.491789,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":19954.67226,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":21663.526967,"text":"dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21919.643399,"text":"that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21963.402978000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":21965.054441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21966.645473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21968.039218,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":32147.585421,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen."},{"kind":"text","t":32357.562737000004,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons."},{"kind":"audio","t":32401.241635000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":32402.726868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32404.436909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32405.234618,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":34322.662859,"text":"die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34489.476511,"text":"ranging from neglect to abuse to extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34530.451753999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34532.028345,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34532.720235,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":45120.454779,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45640.125746,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45724.202848999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45726.150738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45727.759777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45729.474344999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45731.338327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45733.120807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45734.914844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45736.750052999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45738.5435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":45738.984713,"samples":13488,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52148.452291999994,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":52417.872766,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":52463.035415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52464.713106999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52466.453713999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52467.884004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52469.063437,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":62698.598354999995,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62969.660255999996,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":63019.829803,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63021.726164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":63023.152939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":63023.330445,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":63057.008228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63058.500330999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63060.220878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":63060.405155,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":71746.95787299999,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und Lafasto, 1989."},{"kind":"text","t":72076.888719,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team: Larson and Lafasto, 1989."},{"kind":"audio","t":72120.36342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72121.942064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":72122.202425,"samples":13664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":72158.082969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72159.48854199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72160.501395,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":77735.865622,"text":"Seite 109 ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77991.038906,"text":"Page 109 is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":78037.53493899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78038.74618999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78040.485756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78042.35812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":78042.49064999999,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":90749.470462,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":91001.3741,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":91038.97074399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":91040.632162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91042.358718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":91042.455173,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":91075.014604,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91076.57257599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":91076.69757399999,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101125.004208,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101455.313253,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101505.191501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101506.970957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101508.775459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101510.658701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":101510.799332,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101546.199975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101547.655653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101549.42045599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101550.708172,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":107837.681901,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":108093.415308,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":108137.521438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108139.008674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":108140.73374699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108142.538481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":108142.696167,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116361.206048,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116719.697403,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116768.843932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116770.274612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116771.95324599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":116773.79949199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116775.577425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":116775.912659,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126691.56663,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127076.731877,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127129.475984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127131.410422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127132.794773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127134.469201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127136.203088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127138.012518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127139.89984499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":127140.03584,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138045.446737,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super-g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super-g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":138590.275847,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing super-G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138645.867455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138647.48278299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138649.20206799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138650.964808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138652.783563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138654.579012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138656.374992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138657.493974,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":149092.739893,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass die Menschen in der Welt, die wir hier leben,"},{"kind":"text","t":149421.238076,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that people in the world we live in"},{"kind":"audio","t":149471.197756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149472.679634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149474.25295999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149476.005394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":149477.774064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149479.527299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":149479.842083,"samples":12792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":151561.279079,"text":"dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151830.253983,"text":"that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151877.117629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":151878.64195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":151880.346533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151882.14105099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151883.326654,"samples":25528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":159358.194023,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":159628.067938,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159674.860667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159676.203336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159677.804814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159679.522246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159680.710202,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167783.446662,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":168111.75242099998,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":168155.401265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168157.35308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168158.315156,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":168196.09677,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168197.68818199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168199.402029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":168199.958396,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":178190.870799,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichter."},{"kind":"text","t":178562.66911699998,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions on faces that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":178615.0165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178616.502063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178618.233426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":178620.069006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178621.866438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178623.531582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":178625.359891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":178625.626782,"samples":11224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":189578.0304,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":189891.410067,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":189947.780739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189949.32458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":189951.007741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189952.661377,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189954.263946,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":199987.729497,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200405.049265,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast, and swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200454.70384899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200456.461152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200459.052317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":200460.726625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200462.446981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200463.840286,"samples":28760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":210747.511574,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als"},{"kind":"text","t":211016.653381,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and are known as"},{"kind":"audio","t":211063.259712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":211064.751945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":211066.49213199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":211068.145187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":211068.989016,"samples":20728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":213989.968626,"text":"luxuriöse Seebäder bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":214141.517545,"text":"they are known as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":214182.874494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":214184.446808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":214184.855683,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"close","t":224503.079129,"code":1005}]}